OL,3,GNEWSAI want justice after boy's evil
OL,4,Aknife attack on my daughter, says
OL,5,Amother
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a 14-year-old girl who
OL,8,Fwas repeatedly stabbed in an "evil"
OL,9,Fattack by a boy says it is disgraceful
OL,10,Fhe was not jailed.
OL,12,FThe boy, 14, from Wiltshire, had
OL,13,Fstalked the girl after she refused to
OL,14,Fdate him before attacking her with a
OL,15,F6in knife in broad daylight at a shop
OL,16,Fin Cirencester, Gloucestershire, on 15
OL,17,FMarch.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
