OL,3,GNEWSAI want justice after boy's evil
OL,4,Aknife attack on my daughter, says
OL,5,Amother
OL,6,
OL,7,FLast month, he was sentenced to a
OL,8,Fthree-year restraining order and a
OL,9,Fone-year referral order after he
OL,10,Fadmitted wounding with intent,
OL,11,Finflicting grievous bodily harm and
OL,12,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,13,Fpublic place.
OL,15,FThe girl's mother said: "If it hadn't
OL,16,Fbeen for the shopkeeper and her [her
OL,17,Fdaughter's] quick reactions, she would
OL,18,Fhave been dead."
